{"id": "DejwS6fjDvg", "title": "Video by githubsignals", "description": "Claude pxl: Pixel Art as Code\n\nAn AI agent can now watch it paint a pixel-art sprite, step by step, in your browser. The project is called Claude pxl. It turns a simple text file into actual game assets, like PNGs and animated GIFs, using a tiny coding language. You do not need to install heavy software or learn a complex tool. You just write a few lines of code, and the program builds the image for you. The coolest part is the live viewer. It shows you exactly how the art is being drawn, like a timelapse of a painter at work. You can watch the AI add colors, shapes, and lights in real time.\n\nOpen source: crsolver/claude-pxl\n\nFollow for more open source project drops.\n\n#PixelArt #GameAssets #SpriteArt #IndieGameDev", "channel": "githubsignals", "uploader_id": "36619078976", "uploader": "Github Signals", "timestamp": 1792161150, "like_count": 395, "comment_count": 11, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18108703922222977a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 40.577, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNPfkb6FyDC8NcFh3YLdqf36kDv0iGH6jVjCrBA5mHNQlZ1c2MQKz_upPZwXmf1OsfdpYG1dD_v0TW6I1GqI62WwZBMW7HRn0BRKFA.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=_AOZb4-okCAQ7kNvwEHFx8m&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=JYfVudo7Fiqshaj1Z9WXZA&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQMRA1d16ZEBM99UMICbe9o_aKjUBdphfq8xAElIIuD9rg&